      <li id="ref-2">Lucy, L. B. 1974, <i>An iterative technique for the rectification of observed distributions</i>, AJ 79, 745 (Richardson-Lucy). <a href="https://doi.org/10.1086/111605">doi:10.1086/111605</a></li>
      <li id="ref-3">Nagy, J. G. &amp; O’Leary, D. P. 1998, <i>Restoring Images Degraded by Spatially Variant Blur</i>, SIAM J. Sci. Comput. 19, 1063 (the zones blended between their centres). <a href="https://doi.org/10.1137/S106482759528507X">doi:10.1137/S106482759528507X</a></li>
      <li id="ref-4">Whyte, O., Sivic, J. &amp; Zisserman, A. 2014, <i>Deblurring Shaken and Partially Saturated Images</i>, International Journal of Computer Vision 110, 185. <a href="https://doi.org/10.1007/s11263-014-0727-3">doi:10.1007/s11263-014-0727-3</a></li>
      <li id="ref-5">Dey, N. et al. 2006, <i>Richardson-Lucy algorithm with total variation regularization for 3D confocal microscope deconvolution</i>, Microsc. Res. Tech. 69, 260. <a href="https://doi.org/10.1002/jemt.20294">doi:10.1002/jemt.20294</a></li>
      <li id="ref-6">White, R. L. 1994, <i>Image restoration using the damped Richardson-Lucy method</i>, Proc. SPIE 2198, 1342, Eqs. 7, 9 and 10. <a href="https://doi.org/10.1117/12.176819">doi:10.1117/12.176819</a></li>
      <li id="ref-7">Chen, L., Chu, X., Zhang, X. &amp; Sun, J. 2022, <i>Simple Baselines for Image Restoration</i> (NAFNet), ECCV 2022. <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2204.04676">arXiv:2204.04676</a></li>
    </ol>
  </section>
